{"aliases":[],"authors":[],"details":{"availability":"Public runtime, CUA-World environment and task definitions with verifiers and split manifests, reference agents and the environment creation-and-audit pipeline.","benchmark_protocol":{"actions":["mouse","keyboard"],"counts":[{"basis":"reported","evidence_url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2604.06126v1","population":"applications processed into CUA-World (paper v1 abstract)","qualifier":"exact","unit":"software applications","value":200},{"basis":"reported","evidence_url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2604.06126v1","population":"CUA-World (paper v1 abstract)","qualifier":"more-than","unit":"long-horizon tasks","value":10000},{"basis":"computed","evidence_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/cmu-l3/gym-anything/4a8d9672d92d8ff2daef232c4bf9c49d3ac4f2ca/benchmarks/cua_world/splits/verified.json","population":"verified split manifest benchmarks/cua_world/splits/verified.json at 4a8d967","qualifier":"exact","unit":"tasks","value":7150},{"basis":"computed","evidence_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/cmu-l3/gym-anything/4a8d9672d92d8ff2daef232c4bf9c49d3ac4f2ca/benchmarks/cua_world/splits/verified.json","population":"verified split manifest benchmarks/cua_world/splits/verified.json at 4a8d967","qualifier":"exact","unit":"environments","value":191}],"evaluation":"Each task's task.json names a program check (verifier.py) that runs after the episode, with pre-task setup and post-task export hooks; task folders also carry a VLM checklist file.","evidence_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/cmu-l3/gym-anything/4a8d9672d92d8ff2daef232c4bf9c49d3ac4f2ca/README.md","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/cmu-l3/gym-anything/4a8d9672d92d8ff2daef232c4bf9c49d3ac4f2ca/benchmarks/cua_world/splits/verified.json","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/cmu-l3/gym-anything/4a8d9672d92d8ff2daef232c4bf9c49d3ac4f2ca/benchmarks/cua_world/environments/moodle_env/env.json","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/cmu-l3/gym-anything/4a8d9672d92d8ff2daef232c4b